{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年34歲的前TVB新聞主播梁凱寧（Maggie），自離巢後積極發展多元事業，事業順遂，更不時將生活點滴上載到社交平台。</p><p>日前，梁凱寧分享一輯到韓國首爾旅行的靚相，她不僅試穿韓國傳統服飾，更換上秋裝大晒長腿黑絲在街頭打卡。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T18:22:45.081506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T18:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:15:58.325697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T18:15:58.325697+00:00","content_hash":"54e75fc144f2dc505999670652794a5c24a70fd0988dc306171ccbd23bbebe18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}